        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Dangers, Ben Stokes\n- Albums: ¡Hello Friends!\n- Music Projects: Tino Corp.\n- Sports Roles: English Test team vice-captain\n- Topics: Compilation albums, cricket\n\nFacts:\n- ¡Hello Friends! is a compilation album subtitled \"Jack Dangers plays with the records of Tino Corp.\"\n- Jack Dangers DJ'ed ¡Hello Friends!.\n- The music on ¡Hello Friends! was produced by Jack Dangers and Ben Stokes.\n- Benjamin Andrew \"Ben\" Stokes was born on 4 June 1991.\n- Ben Stokes is an English international cricketer.\n- Ben Stokes is the current vice-captain of the English Test team.",
